  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>All raiders seek glory in battle and the spoils that come from a life full of successful raids. Yet only a few live long enough to achieve these aims. A Marauder demonstrates leadership via small skirmishes at first and slowly they build upon their reputation. As their glory rises, so do their opportunities. A Marauder knows how to command any battlefield, whether on the deck of a storm-tossed ship or in the wetlands of Lyonesse. They fight ruthlessly, minimizing their own losses while inflicting devastating harm upon their enemies. True leaders are defined by ferocious resolve, and the Marauder is no exception.</p>"
    },
